@startuml
!include style.iuml
title State machine: FireFusion on the MKR WAN 1300
hide empty description

[*] --> IDLE

state IDLE : camera off (standby)\nno LoRa alarm
state WAIT_CAMERA : CAPTURE sent\nwait max 15 s
state SUSPECT : gas anomaly without\nvisual confirmation\n30 s timer running
state RECHECK : second CAPTURE\nafter 30 s
state ALARM : alarm sent over LoRa\nreason: CAMERA / FLAME /\nGAS_PERSIST

IDLE --> WAIT_CAMERA : gasAnomaly\n[TRIGGER logged]
WAIT_CAMERA --> ALARM : RESULT smoke / fire\n/ reason = CAMERA
WAIT_CAMERA --> ALARM : RESULT normal or error\nand flame / reason = FLAME
WAIT_CAMERA --> SUSPECT : RESULT normal or error\nand no flame
SUSPECT --> IDLE : after 30 s, gas gone\n[CLEARED: false trigger]
SUSPECT --> RECHECK : after 30 s, gas still there
RECHECK --> ALARM : smoke / fire -> CAMERA\nflame -> FLAME\nnormal -> GAS_PERSIST (*)
RECHECK --> IDLE : gas gone
ALARM --> IDLE : gas and flame clear\nfor 60 s [CLEARED]

note right of RECHECK
  (*) escalateOnPersistentGas = true (default).
  If false, the node stays in SUSPECT and
  only raises an alarm with two agreeing
  sources (strict SEC6 / R11 rule).
end note
@enduml
